## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: redact PII using Azure Text Analytics before prompt submission
async function redactPII(input, client) {
  const res = await client.recognizePII(input, { language: 'en' });
  // replace found PII spans with [REDACTED]
  return performRedaction(input, res);
}
```

